#~ msgid "List pending requests and inspect the exact request before deciding:"
#~ msgstr "Enumera les sol·licituds pendents i inspecciona la sol·licitud exacta abans de decidir:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Replace `REQUEST_UUID` with the returned request ID. "
#~ "Review the client and destination, operations, actions,"
#~ " disclosures, periods, expiry, unattended access and "
#~ "OS-lock permission. A key for an agent shows "
#~ "`all_agent_operations` and its whole data categories "
#~ "instead of long lists. Listed disclosures are "
#~ "counted by category; read the full list a page"
#~ " at a time with `cadrumo-runtime config profile"
#~ " automation disclosures ID`, naming the request or "
#~ "grant ID, and pass each page's `next_offset` back"
#~ " as `--offset`. Copy the current `review_digest` from"
#~ " that inspection. Approve only those reviewed "
#~ "permissions, or decline the request:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Substitueix `REQUEST_UUID` per l'ID de sol·licitud "
#~ "retornat. Revisa el client i la destinació, les "
#~ "operacions, les accions, les divulgacions de dades, "
#~ "els períodes, la caducitat, l'accés desatès i el "
#~ "permís durant el bloqueig del sistema operatiu. Una"
#~ " clau per a un agent mostra `all_agent_operations` "
#~ "i les seves categories de dades completes en "
#~ "lloc de llistes llargues. Les divulgacions enumerades "
#~ "es compten per categoria; llegeix la llista completa"
