#~ "stdin`, que llegeix `{\"passphrase\": \"…\"}`;"

#~ msgid "the profile is locked with `cadrumo-runtime config profile lock --all`;"
#~ msgstr "el perfil es bloqueja amb `cadrumo-runtime config profile lock --all`;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "the sign-in reaches its deadline: by default "
#~ "15 minutes after you entered the password, and "
